From d43ef1ff185855b28ab90b82a0ecbf2f005dd6c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrick Rezende <tricio777@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 15:13:48 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] feat: conditional questions editor

Port of the editor part of nextcloud/forms#3833 (head 9999a7f4) to the
5.3.5 options API:

- JumpTargetSelect: per-option "Go to" on radio (incl. Other) and
  dropdown, one "After question N" select on short, long, file, color,
  ranking and grid questions.
- JumpsMixin (upstream useJumps): menu switch, warnings for broken and
  unreachable jumps, optional-question hint; drops goTo/next a type
  does not allow.
- Create.vue: provides questions and jump issues, asks before a move
  turns jumps backward (move back / remove jumps), toasts newly broken,
  unreachable and skippable questions, structural edits wait for
  pending saves of the questions concerned.
- queueQuestionRequest: saves of one question run in sequence; option
  delete drops its jumps; X-Forms-Adjusted triggers a refetch of the
  question.
- One extraSettings debounce per question (was shared by all), so
  changes of two questions within 200 ms are no longer lost.
- QuestionShort clears its validation debounce on unmount.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
